{"time": 1757944066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "231433357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（发现我一直搞不清亚当到底在哪，）"}
{"time": 1757944086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "830278084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1885711027]（）"}
{"time": 1757944169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1692774242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“事已至此，急着调查估计也没啥线索，大家舟车劳顿的，不如先休息一晚再说。”"}
{"time": 1757944182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682613228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（怎么大中午的就休息一晚了（））"}
{"time": 1757944194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "259505071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1692774242]”刚开始就休息吗？是不是不太好“"}
{"time": 1757944197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068502272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "（原来是中午吗？）"}
{"time": 1757944209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885448551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”收了那么多钱诶“"}
{"time": 1757944219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835007539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#用手比划一个大"}
{"time": 1757944221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679275150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1583265015]（）"}
{"time": 1757944249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528143446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（还是打算下酒馆，）"}
{"time": 1757944268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171192814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃把自己想去酒馆打听消息的想法告诉众人"}
{"time": 1757944280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1091105934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“我们在阿卡姆待着真的没问题吗”"}
{"time": 1757944290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "481810923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "“嗯？这么敬业的吗？我还想着摸一天呢。”"}
{"time": 1757944301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "755267122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1171192814]”怎么说呢，没有身份信息，没有相貌甚至没有特征，从身份查起很难的啦“"}
{"time": 1757944349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203795804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1381506084]”哦不，说不定……“"}
{"time": 1757944356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1534178258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“我想，对方可能属于一个组织，了解一下当地势力总不会有错…”"}
{"time": 1757944358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "416317357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”他是一只眼“"}
{"time": 1757944376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305386281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”要么就是中二病“"}
{"time": 1757944397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156015245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“况且凡走过就会有痕迹，一些都市传说也有可能帮助我们发现蛛丝马迹”"}
{"time": 1757944487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "906065178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“蛤，那也太好运了吧”"}
{"time": 1757944487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043857054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=481810923]“我只是担心可能会有一些邪恶的仪式可能不会给我们太大时间…不过这个委托发布也挺久的了，慢慢来，小心为上也好”"}
{"time": 1757944498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981191839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1534178258]”组织作案？确实是不错的想法。不过一个人倒还能解释成柯南道尔的信徒，但是会有一群柯南道尔的信徒吗？组织可都是无利不起早的样子，动机会很成疑“"}
{"time": 1757944502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649710233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“就像是小说一样”"}
{"time": 1757944587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193710510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1981191839]＃笑笑“我只是猜测，一切更有力的发现都应该建立在有效信息之上，而我们应该先去搜索各种信息，再拼凑出真相。”"}
{"time": 1757944596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410834084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃尝试寻找附近的酒馆"}
{"time": 1757944608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807427667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1156015245]”首先，通过已有信息直接排查人感觉很难，只有一个疑似眼瞎的特征。不如我们先从动机入手，倒推凶手的行动？“"}
{"time": 1757944664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1850479162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃听到同伴的话停下，“你说的也有道理…那么动机可能是什么呢？”"}
{"time": 1757944713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501586999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”很可惜，没有任何直接的证据证明凶手的动机。目前看来可能有二“"}
{"time": 1757944747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1534245910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”其一，狂信徒。在博物馆随机偷一个文物然后走“"}
{"time": 1757944832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336083267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”其二，有原则的狂信徒，如同刚才那位管理员，对某种传说深信不疑，有目的性地偷取该藏品“"}
{"time": 1757944889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960201197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“剩下的动机可能是销赃之类的，但是有两个点说不通：”"}
{"time": 1757944937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1736176776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“首先，比起抢柯南道尔博物馆，显然大英博物馆的东西更值钱，没必要偷一个价值不高的东西”"}
{"time": 1757944960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1214355737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“其次，销赃肯定是越多越好，不可能只是偷一个东西就走”"}
{"time": 1757945024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819580193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“所以可以推断的是，这个窃贼的动机很有可能是因为关于‘星尘’的某种传说，他想要发挥这个物件在传说中的某种作用”"}
{"time": 1757945080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196921448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“所以，比起从筛查人入手，说不定寻找传说会更高效一点”"}
{"time": 1757945091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1559537425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“所以刚刚朱蒂的猜测可能不无道理…星辰有着某种可怕的作用…进一步联想，窃贼可能为了发挥这个作用所以来到了阿卡姆”"}
{"time": 1757945104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818853318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“没错”"}
{"time": 1757945130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563912512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“那我们可以先去图书馆找找线索”"}
{"time": 1757945177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1772296429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#忽然意识到自己莫名开始夸夸其谈，顿时心生羞愧"}
