{"time": 1758026608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196508848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "布莱克和安诺来到了中心区的阿卡姆警察局总部"}
{"time": 1758026616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622927797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "这是一栋有着 20 世纪 20 年代风格的德国建筑。在这座三层高的混凝土建筑上，是一排排形状同一、深色的椭圆形大窗户。大楼下面有一个居留区，那些被逮捕的闹事者会被关在这里。"}
{"time": 1758026650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357855611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "而另一边，亚当、阿斯顿和菲莉汐娅来到了图书馆"}
{"time": 1758026663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319072612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "阿卡姆公共图书馆藏在鳞次栉比之中，宛如封存的历史。图书馆经过了财政拨款的翻新，古色古香之中又不失为现代化，这里有着约 10 万册的图书和系统化的档案库，其在市政和城市历史方面的藏书非常齐全。"}
{"time": 1758026772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1724523369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（动）"}
{"time": 1758026809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549951592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "*出于职业习惯，观察图书馆进出的人流量情况，同时看看有没有漂亮的柜台小姐姐"}
{"time": 1758026827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1377303200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（这什么职业的习惯）"}
{"time": 1758026880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018908173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃进入图书馆，询问管理员，寻找本市的历史传说民俗文化区"}
{"time": 1758026906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651176417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=549951592]（你无敌了）"}
{"time": 1758026912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1603302682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "（出于长期调查婚外情的习惯）"}
{"time": 1758026960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "805401994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#依照索引寻找关于“星尘”的民俗神话"}
{"time": 1758026985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821607112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=549951592]工作日的人流量并不算多，多是一些闲逛的大学生以及带小孩接受文化熏陶的家长"}
{"time": 1758027030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519240707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "你们走进图书馆，年轻的管理员就坐在前台，胸牌上写着她的名字：茱莉亚·马斯特森"}
{"time": 1758027045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "818529340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=805401994]（图书馆）"}
