{"time": 1758027056, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1512126192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[菲莉汐娅]进行技能[图书馆:60]检定: 1D100=74 失败，人面不知何处去，桃花依旧笑春风"}
{"time": 1758027069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2066786575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“你们好呀”看着阿斯顿和亚当走近，她亲切地和你们打招呼"}
{"time": 1758027104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "843394928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "在这之间，菲莉汐娅在顺着索引翻着找，可惜并没有找到‘星尘’相关的资料"}
{"time": 1758027185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "638697123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "*整理下衣装回应：“你好，美丽的女士，我是一家民俗专栏的作者，想和你打听下关于当地一些奇妙或者有趣的风俗，不知方便占用一点时间吗？”"}
{"time": 1758027201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990830455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“您好，我们第一次来阿卡姆市。作为旅行爱好者，我们有个习惯——那便是拜访每个旅游城市的图书馆，然后看看该市的历史或者民俗传说……美丽的小姐，可以请您为我们介绍一番嘛？”"}
{"time": 1758027312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "575927294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（有点感觉你们一起来的，然后自己问自己的有点搞）"}
{"time": 1758027315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1304735652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（不过毕竟是跑团）"}
{"time": 1758027345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761443462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "（那么亚当先？）"}
{"time": 1758027346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "623564601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（雾，虽然我发现后，说的是我们）"}
{"time": 1758027347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "988407385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯....好”"}
{"time": 1758027357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580589736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（你们其实问题都是一样的吧）"}
{"time": 1758027363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1852802183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（对的）"}
{"time": 1758027367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "738614313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "（合并成一个问题吧）"}
{"time": 1758027533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "365933334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（日了电脑死机了）"}
{"time": 1758027538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1666336690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（雾其实我突然想到，民俗专栏作者和旅行爱好者身份并不冲突）"}
{"time": 1758027539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260907951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（这个风俗有点恐怖的）"}
{"time": 1758027589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910290313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "（其实两人问的都是一件事，为了节省kp算力还是合并成一个问题好了）"}
{"time": 1758027617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1033191074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（正是我的意思，）"}
{"time": 1758027769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070983115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（我对设定的历史不熟）"}
{"time": 1758027778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998128257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（就按自己理解来咯）"}
{"time": 1758027804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616702200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“两位都是来旅行的吗”"}
{"time": 1758027852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "941280598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“我们阿卡姆市坐落在海边，很久以前，这里还是个小渔村”"}
{"time": 1758027928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "41243953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“不过随着科技发展，这里逐渐壮大起来，由于独厚的位置，成为了二战时期的重要据点。”"}
{"time": 1758028007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332521290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“大部分都是以军工产业为主，无数枪炮在这里倾泻而出，运送至前线。因此同样的，这里也曾是军事打击的重要地带。”"}
{"time": 1758028162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533676348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“所幸是无数爆炸哀嚎的战争过后过后，坚强的阿卡姆人重建了家园，军工企业逐渐转化为民企，主要以外贸和海鲜为主，经济稳中向好。”"}
{"time": 1758028272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1161206580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“再加上几十年前暴风雪的政府补贴，这里吸引了大量人才，城市也得以逐渐褪去殖民地的渔村外貌。”"}
{"time": 1758028420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038001837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“在过去市长的引进政策下，密斯卡托尼克大学和当时众多科技公司连接。我们现在便利的生活，大部分都受益于他们呢。”"}
{"time": 1758028467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "905518506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“但是说到风俗的话，哼哼”她面容一转成阴笑"}
{"time": 1758028507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869296102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃对管理员小姐的神情产生好奇“风俗有什么特别之处嘛？”"}
{"time": 1758028796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029540886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“当然，因为长年的战争，地下镇压了无数亡魂。因此这里也发展出了独特的驱邪仪式”"}
{"time": 1758028901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287703434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "（不过讲真二战老美本土被打击，怕不是高堡奇人的世界线）"}
{"time": 1758028968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2120308566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“比如丰收节，农民会奉上最后一批谷物以及黑色的山羊，将其埋在田地之中，以祈求好运”"}
{"time": 1758029030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "818702274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“每当孩童诞生，一些家族的长辈会批上鱼鳞做的衣裳，在海边跳祈福舞”"}
{"time": 1758029048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618081191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（黑山羊这一块）"}
{"time": 1758029060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923721448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2447503622"}, "sender": {"id": "2447503622", "name": "阿斯顿真在飞"}, "message": "（该不会要群星闪耀了吧）"}
{"time": 1758029076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1655748732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（雾）"}
{"time": 1758029117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648999524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“也由于一段长时间的与世隔绝，这里传闻催生出各种邪教，因此家长都会教导孩子们不要深入山林，以防不测”"}
